'''Heavy Infantry Mandalorians'''<ref name="Hasbro">{{HasbroCite|set=Star Wars: The Black Series|pack=#D2: Heavy Infantry Mandalorian|altlink=https://www.rebelscum.com/story/actionfigure/Hasbro_The_Black_Series_6Inch_Heavy_Infantry_Mandalorian_185745.asp}}</ref> were [[Mandalorian warrior]]s equipped with heavy [[beskar]] [[armor]]<ref name="Chapter 3" /> known as [[Heavy Infantry Mandalorian Armor]]<ref name="Secrets of the Bounty Hunters">''[[Star Wars: The Secrets of the Bounty Hunters]]''</ref> and [[blaster cannon]]s. [[Paz Vizsla]] was a Heavy Infantry Mandalorian who served with [[the Tribe]]<ref name="Chapter 3" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|3}}</ref> He wielded a [[M-55 Medium Repeating Blaster]].<ref name="GoH">''[[Star Wars: Galaxy of Heroes]]''</ref>

